1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:03,350
(Sheldon:)Crafty old gal.

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:06,220
(Leonard:)Excuse me, but you are not the
only distinguished scientist

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:07,520
(Leonard:)in this apartment.

4
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,290
(Leonard:)I've been published in
peer-reviewed journals,

5
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:11,420
(Leonard:)I received a Dissertation
of the Year award

6
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,420
(Leonard:)for experimental
particle physics.

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,860
(Sheldon:)No, that can't be it.

8
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,290
(Sheldon:)And since you seem

9
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,500
(Sheldon:)to have forgotten,
the reason we live together

10
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,160
(Sheldon:)is we're best friends.

11
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:23,270
(Sheldon:)And I got your back, Jack.

12
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:29,010
(Leonard:)That was a great meal.
I'm glad you
enjoyed it.

13
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:32,110
(Leonard:)The only time I eat this well
is when my mom's in town

14
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:34,610
(Leonard:)- and she takes me out to dinner.
- Is that so?

15
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,450
(Leonard:)You kind of
remind me of her.

16
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:40,180
(Leonard:)She enjoys making people
uncomfortable, too.

17
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:43,250
(Mrs Latham:)Well, you remind me of
a boy I dated in college.

18
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:45,190
- No kidding.
- Sweet boy.

19
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:46,490
(Mrs Latham:)Very smart.

20
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:48,960
(Mrs Latham:)If only he'd had money.

21
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:52,430
(Leonard:)Yeah, um...

22
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:54,900
(Leonard:)so, hey,
speaking of money,

23
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:58,200
(Leonard:)how are you feeling about
helping the physics department

24
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,140
(Leonard:)get a cryogenic centrifugal
pump and molecular sieve?

